[gd_resource type="SpriteFrames" format=3]

; The crew sprite WITH the pressure suit on (WI-67).
;
; Lifted verbatim out of pawn_base.tscn's sub-resource so both wardrobes are
; files rather than one file and one embedded sub-resource - which is what lets
; test_crew_frames.gd compare them animation for animation. Every animation name,
; frame count, speed and loop flag here must match crew_unsuited_frames.tres, or a
; suit coming off mid-stride lands on an animation that does not exist.

